WEBVTT

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.490
Why...

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.090
I...

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.080
This is...

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.920
Welcome home, Little Bitch.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:38.310
You look kinda tired from Ayato-kun

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.990
sucking so much blood from you yesterday.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.050
Raito-kun...

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:46.220
I missed you while you were gone.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:51.480
Just thinking about what they've been doing

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.860
to you over there turns me on.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:06.270
Aww... Did I remind you?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.750
S-Stop!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:12.710
Resist me more, Little Bitch.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.710
D-Don't!

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.170
Oh, what's this?

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:35.360
You've changed somehow, 
haven't you, Little Bitch?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.370
I love that look on your face. 
It's so irresistible.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.320
Feel me more...

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:54.650
I'll make you feel so good,

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.350
you'll forget everything.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.880
Why don't you stop right there?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.680
Oh, it's just you, Reiji.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.070
You wanna join us?

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:12.430
There's something I want to ask her.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:15.010
Get changed and come to the living room.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:30.760
Um... Reiji-san, you wanted 
to ask me something?

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:34.960
Can you tell me what you know about them?

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.550
What I know about them?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.670
Isn't there anything at all you've noticed?

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.740
Well...

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.600
I see you're as useless as ever.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:55.350
U-Um, I'm not sure why,

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:59.110
but they kept calling me "Eve."

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.810
Eve...

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:04.830
I see.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:09.490
Did they mention anything about "Adam"?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.170
As the one who possesses the blood of Eve,

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.420
you should be able to find him without error.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:23.870
You'll find Adam.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.300
Yes...

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.360
Just as I thought.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.900
Um, Reiji-san... Do you know 
something about this?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:40.060
Really, what could those 
ex-humans be planning?

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.690
You even know they were once humans?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:47.000
Of course. It's not that hard to figure out.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.590
Anything else?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.820
Um...

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:53.470
Unbelievable... That's all you know?

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.910
What have you been doing there all this time?

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.400
Did you do nothing but let them

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.840
suck your blood whenever they wished?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.030
How foolish.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.610
Come to think of it,

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:15.310
they said they needed my blood for some plan.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.990
For "Him," or something...

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.380
So that's it.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.610
You heard all that, right, Shu?

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:31.490
Have you heard anything from Father?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.660
Not really.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.250
But he's probably planning something.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.260
So it seems.

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.250
Um, Reiji-san...

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.940
Why did all the Mukami 
brothers call me "Eve"?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.520
Kanato-kun.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:57.500
So you just disappear and 
reappear whenever you please?

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.770
How could you?

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:04.270
I won't forgive you even if 
you cry and beg for it.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:09.030
Did you have fun living with them?

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.280
Subaru-kun... I didn't...

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:19.360
Like I believe you. Damn, I'm pissed.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.840
You sound all tough now,

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:27.560
but the truth is you missed Little Bitch 
when they took her, right?

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.260
U-Um...

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.250
What the hell are you guys talking about?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.810
I don't want their names mentioned here.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:41.280
You too, Pancake. Don't you 
dare say their names ever again.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.630
Finally, everyone is here.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.970
Why did you gather us here?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.740
Yeah, this almost never happens.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.370
And it's not like we're having a 
dinner party. What's the idea?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:08:00.730
I have things to do too, you know. 
What is this all about?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:04.790
Now is not the time to be so careless.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.130
So what's going on?

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.460
We don't have much time 
until the next full moon.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.310
And? What of it?

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.090
Isn't the next one a lunar eclipse?

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.470
It's not just a lunar eclipse.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.730
There's something more?

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:26.140
It's a special lunar eclipse 
that occurs simultaneously

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:27.900
in both the human and demon worlds.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.740
Our vampire powers will decrease tremendously.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.800
That doesn't sound like such a big deal.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:35.760
No...

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:41.870
We shouldn't take this lightly.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.480
I hope nothing happens.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:16.160
Reiji-san, may I come in?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.900
Please.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.750
Pardon me.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.040
Is something the matter?

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.620
Well... I just thought maybe you'd know

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:39.360
why I was called Eve...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:44.200
What my blood has to do with all this,

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:49.100
and who this "Him" the Mukami 
brothers were talking about is...

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.770
You don't need to know about that.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:04.370
In the first place, I doubt they'll 
be able to carry out their plan.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.250
What do you mean?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.920
Reiji-san!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.470
You really are a fool.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:23.580
However, it is true that 
your blood is special.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.360
It's all because of this blood.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.290
The sweet scent drives everyone insane...

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.030
The idea of them stealing this blood

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.160
displeases me.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:25.860
Come on, resist me more. 
Show me more pain.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:30.340
The way you surrender yourself to the 
impending pleasure drives me crazy.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:34.520
With that overwhelming 
guilt, let's fall together.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:40.530
That's it... Cry for me more. Lose yourself.
